      <scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
         <p>Correspondence and subject files, 1991-2003, are comprised of author files, board records, and subject files.  Includes clippings, correspondence, financial records and reports.  </p>

<p>Board meeting materials include agendas, bylaws, correspondence, executive director reports, and minutes.</p>



      </scopecontent>



